# Frontend (Vite) configuration. Only VITE_* values reach the browser: NEVER put secrets here.
# Base URL of the Node API. Default "/api/v1" works with the Vite dev/preview proxy (same origin; recommended).
# For a separately hosted API use its full URL (and add this site's origin to FRONTEND_ORIGIN in the backend .env):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
# Dev/preview proxy target (read by vite.config.ts, not exposed to the browser):
# VITE_DEV_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:5000
